		"soldier_line": {
			"text": "Trouble's all we see. The garrison sends a patrol when it remembers we exist. You've the look of someone who finishes a job, and there's a wolf pack out there that needs finishing.",
			"choices": [
				{
					"text": "Tell me about the wolves.",
